      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celina%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "James Watson Riley founded Celina in 1834, laying the groundwork for the town’s future.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celina%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Nestled on the northwestern shore of Grand Lake St., Celina offers scenic waterfront views.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celina%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every July, Celina hosts the Celina Lake Festival, a celebration of the town’s heritage on Grand Lake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
